                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does winter drive for skincare brands?</h3>
                                        <p>20-30% of Q4 + Q1 revenue for skincare brands with seasonal-aware campaigns. Higher for hydration + body care specialists.</p>
                                        <h3>Should skincare brands change formulations for winter?</h3>
                                        <p>Ideally yes — richer formulations + winter-specific SKUs. Alternative: winter-specific content + usage guidance for existing SKUs.</p>
                                        <h3>Is winter wellness worth targeting?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — immunity + vitamin C + hot beverages + comfort categories all peak Dec-Feb. Sustained multi-month campaigns work.</p>
                                        <h3>How do multi-region brands handle winter?</h3>
                                        <p>Plan per hemisphere — Northern Hemisphere (Dec-Feb) + Southern Hemisphere (June-Aug). Different content + timing per market.</p>
